{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120751","id":3959190185,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7r_HKp","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120751","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120751.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120751.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120751","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120751/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120751/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120751/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a53041330df25532b5a246c34c3dcfb08606fd25","number":120751,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"iOS, Android: Ensure OS.alert() blocks the caller thread","user":{"login":"yorkyang2333","id":78467289,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDY3Mjg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78467289?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333","html_url":"https://github.com/yorkyang2333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yorkyang2333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nCloses #49969\n\nFixes an issue where calling `OS.alert()` from a background thread behaves incorrectly on iOS and Android. Prior to this fix:\n- On Android, `OS.alert()` would return immediately on background threads without waiting for the user to dismiss the dialog.\n- On iOS, `OS.alert()` would invoke UIKit methods directly from a background thread and spin an empty `NSRunLoop`, leading to deadlocks or engine freezes.\n\n## Additional information\n\nThis PR ensures that `OS.alert()` safely blocks the caller background thread until the dialog is closed by the user:\n- **Android**: Utilizes a `CountDownLatch` in `GodotNativeBridge.kt` to securely block the background thread until the UI thread invokes the dismiss callback.\n- **iOS**: Uses a `dispatch_semaphore` to block the background thread while safely presenting the `UIAlertController` on the main thread. If called on the main thread, it continues to use the existing `NSRunLoop` polling.\n\n<!--\nAdditional information you want to share with the reviewer:\n- Have you tested your changes on all platforms?\n- Do you have any concerns or open questions?\n- Any follow-up issues you've planned?\n-->\n**AI Assistance Declaration:** \nThe issue localization and the implementation of thread synchronization mechanisms in this PR were assisted by AI.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-29T22:50:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T06:24:12Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T23:53:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"87eded0b1a00e0e32beb5d9579a5ccb92519af04","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"yorkyang2333:fix-mobile-background-threading","ref":"fix-mobile-background-threading","repo":null,